{"id":"wb-7-1799","name":"洛阳涧西苏式建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"澗西蘇式建築群","text":"涧西苏式建筑群是指苏联援建156项重点工程时在洛建造的厂房和生活区等，始建于1954年，投产于1965年。建筑群位于中国河南省洛阳市涧西区建设路50号，总面积9743.43平方米。主要包括一拖、中铝洛铜等企业的厂房，以及涧西区2号街坊、10号街坊等苏联建筑。建筑为苏联新古典主义加以云纹等中国民族装饰。\n2013被列为中华人民共和国第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BE%97%E8%A5%BF%E8%98%87%E5%BC%8F%E5%BB%BA%E7%AF%89%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":91950548,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91950548","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7838024f353005529693eb1b.jpg","title":"20231231_Soviet-style_apartment_buildings_along_Wuhan_Road_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20231231_Soviet-style_apartment_buildings_along_Wuhan_Road_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/20231231_Soviet-style_apartment_buildings_along_Wuhan_Road_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Soviet-style apartment buildings along Wuhan Road","width":320,"height":213}}